  <para style="h">Yohane 1</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yohane 1</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohane 1</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoh1</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yohane 1</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1JN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mawu ɔ, la i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 1:1" />Kristo ngɛ kɛ je je ɔ sisije. Wɔ nitsɛmɛ wa na lɛ kɛ wa hɛ ngmɛ, nɛ wa nu e gbi. Wa na lɛ nɛ wa ta e he kɛ wa nine. Lɛ ji Mawu wami munyu ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1JN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 1:2" />A wo nɔ nɛ ji Wami munyu nɛ je Mawu ngɔ ɔ kɛ tsɔɔ wɔ nɛ wa yeɔ e he odase kaa wa na lɛ. Kristo he munyu wa ngɛ tue ɔ nɛ, nɔ nɛ ji neneene wami ɔ. E kɛ Tsɛ ɔ nɛ ngɛ, nɛ a je lɛ kɛ tsɔɔ wɔ. <verse eid="1JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 1:3" />Ní nɛ wa na, nɛ wa nu ɔ he odase wa ngɛ yee kɛ ngɛ nyɛ hu tsɔɔe, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛɛ kɛ wɔ nɛ pee kake kaa bɔ nɛ waa kɛ Tsɛ ɔ kɛ e Bi Yesu Kristo ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="1JN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 1:4" />Nɛ ke nyɛ pee kaa bɔ nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ ngmae ngɛ womi nɛ ɔ mi ɔ, lɛɛ nyɛ hu nyɛ ma na bua jɔmi babauu kaa wɔ.<verse eid="1JN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 1:5" />Enɛ ɔ ji munyu nɛ Mawu kɛ ha wɔ ke waa fiɛ kɛ ha nyɛ kaa la ji Mawu, nɛ diblii be e mi kulaa. <verse eid="1JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 1:6" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, ke wa ke e huɛhi ji wɔ, se wa ngɛ mumi mi diblii kɛ yayami mi lolo ɔ, lɛɛ wa ngɛ wa he sisie. <verse eid="1JN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 1:7" />Se ke waa kɛ Mawu ngɛ, kaa bɔ nɛ Kristo kɛ lɛ ngɛ ɔ, lɛɛ waa kɔ wa si bi ngɛ nyakpɛ huɛ bɔmi kɛ bua jɔmi mi, nɛ Yesu nɛ ji e bi ɔ muɔ maa tsu wa he kɛ je yayami tsuaa yayami mi.<verse eid="1JN 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 1:8" />Ke wa ke yayami ko be wa he ɔ, wɔ nitsɛmɛ wa he nɛ wa ngɛ sisie, nɛ wa sume nɛ waa ngɔ anɔkuale dloomi munyu ɔ. <verse eid="1JN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 1:9" />Se ke wa jaje wa yayami ɔmɛ kɛ tsɔɔ lɛ ɔ, anɔkualetsɛ kɛ dalɔ ji lɛ, e maa ngɔ wa yayami ɔmɛ kɛ ke wɔ, nɛ e maa tsu wa he kɛ je yayami fɛɛ yayami mi. <verse eid="1JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 1:10" />Ke wa ke wa pee we yayami ɔ, wa ngɛ Mawu lakpatsɛ tsɛe, nɛ e munyu ɔ be wa mi.<verse eid="1JN 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1JN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 2:1" />Ye bimɛ, i ngɛ nyɛ enɛ ɔ ngmae bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛ ko pee yayami. Se ke nyɛ pee yayami ɔ, nɔ ko ngɛ nɛ ma kpa Tsɛ ɔ pɛɛ kɛ ha nyɛ. Lɛ ji Yesu Kristo, nɔ nɛ lɛ pɛ nɛ e hi, nɛ e sa Mawu hɛ mi kɛ pi si ɔ. <verse eid="1JN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 2:2" />Lɛ nɛ e ngɔ Mawu muklii mi fumi nɛ e na ngɛ wa he yayami ɔmɛ a he ɔ kɛ fɔ e nɔ nɛ e kpata waa kɛ Mawu wa kpɛti. Lɛ nɛ a ngɔ kɛ je wa he yayami ɔmɛ, nɛ pi wɔ kɛkɛ, se mohu je ɔ tsuo he yayami.<verse eid="1JN 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 2:3" />Nɛ ke ji wa yeɔ e mlaa amɛ a nɔ ɔ, lɛɛ wa ma nyɛ de ke e nihi ji wɔ. <verse eid="1JN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 2:4" />Nɔ nɛ deɔ ke e le Mawu, se e yi e mlaa amɛ a nɔ ɔ, lakpatsɛ ji lɛ, nɛ anɔkuale ɔ be e mi. <verse eid="1JN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 2:5" />Se nɔ nɛ yeɔ Mawu Munyu ɔ nɔ anɔkuale mi ɔ, e mi nɛ Mawu suɔmi ɔ ngɛ kɛ pi si. Nɛ kɛ gu enɛ ɔ nɔ nɛ a ma nyɛ maa le kaa Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ ji lɛ aloo e pi Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ.<verse eid="1JN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hemi kɛ yemi kami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 2:6" />Nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ ke Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ ji lɛ ɔ, e hi si kaa bɔ nɛ Kristo hi si ɔ. <verse eid="1JN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 2:7" />Anyɛmimɛ suɔli, pi mlaa he nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ woe kaa nyɛɛ ye nɔ, se e ji mlaa momo nɛ a kɛ ha nyɛ kɛ je sisije. Nyɛ nu kulaa hyɛ. <verse eid="1JN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 2:8" />Se kɛ ɔ, e peeɔ mlaa he be fɛɛ be, nɛ e tsuɔ ni kɛ haa nyɛ kaa bɔ nɛ e pee kɛ ha Kristo ɔ. Nɛ ke wa ye mlaa nɛ ɔ nɛ tsɔɔ kaa waa suɔ wa si bi ɔ nɔ ɔ, diblii ɔ nɛ ngɛ wa mi ɔ maa laa nɛ la he nɛ ji wami nɛ ngɛ Kristo mi ɔ ma kpɛ ngɛ wa mi.<verse eid="1JN 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 2:9" />Nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ deɔ ke Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ ji lɛ, se e sume e nyɛmi nɔmlɔ ɔ, e ngɛ diblii ɔ mi kɛ sa. <verse eid="1JN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 2:10" />Se nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ suɔ e nyɛmi nɔmlɔ ɔ, e ngɛ Kristo mi. E be nyɛɛe ngɛ diblii mi nɛ e ma tɛ nɔ́, nɛ e be yayami hu pee. <verse eid="1JN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 2:11" />Ejakaa nɔ nɛ sume e nyɛmi ɔ, e ngɛ nyɛɛe ngɛ diblii mi, nɛ e li he nɛ e yaa, ejakaa diblii ɔ yu e hɛ ngmɛ.<verse eid="1JN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 2:12" />Ye bimɛ tsɔwi, i ngɛ nyɛ tsuo enɛ ɔmɛ ngmae, ejakaa a ngɔ nyɛ yayami ɔmɛ kɛ ke nyɛ ngɛ Kristo wa Yiwamihelɔ ɔ biɛ mi. <verse eid="1JN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 2:13" />I ngɛ nyɛ nɔkɔtɔma amɛ enɛ ɔmɛ dee, ejakaa nyɛɛ lɛɛ nyɛ le Kristo anɔkuale mi, nɔ nɛ ngɛ kɛ je sisije ɔ. Nɛ nyɛ nɛ ji nihewi ɔmɛ, i kɛ nyɛ ngɛ munyu tue, ejakaa nyɛ ye kunimi ngɛ nyɛɛ kɛ Abosiami nyɛ kpɛti ta a mi. Nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ jokuɛwi ɔmɛ ngmae, ejakaa nyɛ hu nyɛ kase nɛ nyɛ le Mawu nɛ ji wa Tsɛ ɔ.<verse eid="1JN 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyɛɛ jɔɔ je ɔ se dimi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 2:14" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ tsɛ ɔmɛ, nyɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ nyɛ le neneene Mawu ɔ, kɛ nyɛ nihewi nɛ nyɛ ngɛ he wami, nɛ Mawu munyu ɔ ngɛ nyɛ tsui mi nɛ nyɛ ye Abosiami nɔ kunimi ɔ, i ngɛ nyɛ dee ke, <verse eid="1JN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 2:15" />nyɛɛ jɔɔ je nɛ ɔ kɛ e mi nɔ́ yayami ɔmɛ suɔmi. Ke nyɛ suɔ kikɛmɛ a ní nɛ ɔmɛ ɔ, e tsɔɔ kaa nyɛ sume Mawu anɔkuale mi. <verse eid="1JN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 2:16" />Ejakaa je mi ní nɛ ɔmɛ, nɛ ji akɔnɔ ni yayamihi, kaa yo se nyɛɛmi, hɛ kɔmi níhi, kɛ fiami ngɛ ni nami loo blɔ nya nami he ɔ, a pi níhi nɛ je Mawu ngɔ. A je je yayami nɛ ɔ nitsɛ mi. <verse eid="1JN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 2:17" />Se je ɔ maa be kɛ e mi ni yayami ɔmɛ, nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ngɛ Mawu suɔmi nya ni pee ɔ, e maa hi si kɛ ya neneene.<verse eid="1JN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 2:18" />Bimɛ nɛ a suɔ, je nɛ ɔ nyagbe ngmlɛfia a su. Nyɛ nu kaa lakpa Kristo ma, nɔ nɛ te si kɛ wo Kristo ɔ; nɛ kikɛmɛ a nimli nɛ ɔmɛ fuu ba momo. Nɛ enɛ ɔ ji nɔ́ nɛ haa wɔ nɔ mi mami kaa je ɔ nyagbe su ta. <verse eid="1JN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 2:19" />Kikɛmɛ a lakpa kristo se nyɛɛli nɛ ɔmɛ hi wa asafo ɔmɛ a mi hyɛ, se a pi wa asafo mi bimɛ anɔkuale mi; kaa wa kpɛti nihi ji mɛ jinɛ a be jee. Nɛ a jemi nɛ a je ɔ, e tsɔɔ kaa a pi wa kpɛti nimli kulaa.<verse eid="1JN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 2:20" />Se nyɛɛ lɛɛ nyɛ be ja, ejakaa Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ba nyɛ nɔ nɛ nyɛ le anɔkuale ɔ. <verse eid="1JN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 2:21" />I ngɛ nyɛ ngmae, pi nɛ nyɛ li anɔkuale ɔ he je, se kaa nihi nɛ le anɔkuale ɔ. I ngɛ nyɛ kɔkɔ bɔe kaa nihi nɛ le slɔɔto nɛ ngɛ anɔkuale kɛ lakpa kpɛti.<verse eid="1JN 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 2:22" />Nɛ mɛnɔ ji lakpatsɛ pe kulaa? Nɔ nɛ deɔ ke tsa pi Yesu ji Kristo ɔ. Kikɛmɛ a nɔmlɔ ɔ, lakpa kristo se nyɛɛlɔ i, ejakaa e he we Mawu nɛ ji Tsɛ ɔ kɛ e Bi ɔ nɔ yi. <verse eid="1JN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 2:23" />Ejakaa nɔ nɛ he we Kristo nɛ ji Mawu Bi ɔ nɔ yi ɔ, e be Mawu nɛ ji Tsɛ ɔ hu nɔ hee maa ye. Se nɔ nɛ heɔ Kristo nɛ ji Mawu Bi ɔ nɔ yeɔ ɔ, e heɔ Mawu nɛ ji Tsɛ ɔ hu nɔ yeɔ.<verse eid="1JN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 2:24" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛɛ ya nɔ nɛ nyɛ he nɔ́ nɛ a tsɔɔ nyɛ kɛ je sisije ɔ nɛ nyɛɛ ye. Ke nyɛ pee ja a, nyɛɛ kɛ Mawu nɛ ji Tsɛ ɔ kɛ e Bi ɔ maa hi huɛ bɔmi mi be fɛɛ be. <verse eid="1JN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1JN 2:25" />Nɛ neneene yi wami nami ji nɔ́ nɛ lɛ nitsɛ e wo wɔ si ngɛ he.<verse eid="1JN 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1JN 2:26" />Nɔ́ nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ ngmae ngɛ lakpa kristo ɔ he ɔ, e kɔɔ nihi nɛ maa sisi nyɛ, nɛ a ma ha nyɛ maa tla blɔ ɔ a he. <verse eid="1JN 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1JN 2:27" />Se nyɛ nine su Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɔ, nɛ e ngɛ nyɛ mi. E he hia we kaa nɔ ko nɛ e ba tsɔɔ nyɛ nɔ́ nɛ da. Ejakaa Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ tsɔɔ nyɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ, nɛ lɛ ji Anɔkuale ɔ nɛ, e pi lakpatsɛ. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, kaa bɔ nɛ e de ɔ, nyɛɛ hi Kristo mi, nyɛ ko je e mi gblee. <verse eid="1JN 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1JN 2:28" />Jehanɛ ɔ, ye bimɛ tsɔwi, nyɛɛ hi Nutsɔ ɔ mi, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ke e ba a, zo nɛ ko pee nyɛ kaa nyɛɛ kɛ lɛ ma ya kpe. <verse eid="1JN 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1JN 2:29" />Akɛnɛ wa le kaa Mawu hi be tsuaa be, nɛ nɔ́ nɛ da pɛ nɛ e peeɔ he je ɔ, wa ma nyɛ de anɔkuale mi ke, nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ peeɔ nɔ́ dadɛ ɔ, Mawu bi ji lɛ.<verse eid="1JN 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1JN 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 3:1" />Nyɛɛ hyɛ bɔ nɛ wa Hiɔwe Tsɛ ɔ suɔ wɔ saminya ha, nɛ e ha he blɔ kaa a tsɛ wɔ Mawu bimɛ, nɛ ja a wa ji. Se akɛnɛ nihi fuu li Mawu he je ɔ, a nui sisi kaa e bimɛ ji wɔ. <verse eid="1JN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 3:2" />Anyɛmimɛ nɛ a suɔ, amlɔ nɛ ɔ Mawu bimɛ ji wɔ, se nɔ́ nɛ wa ma ji hwɔɔ se ɔ, a je we kɛ tsɔɔ we wɔ lolo. Se nɔ́ nɛ wa le kɛkɛ ji kaa ke e ba pue ɔ, wa maa hi kaa lɛ, ejakaa wa maa na lɛ kaa bɔ nɛ e ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="1JN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 3:3" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ heɔ enɛ ɔ yeɔ anɔkuale mi ɔ, e si himi he nɛ tsɔ, ejakaa Kristo ngɛ klɔuklɔu. <verse eid="1JN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 3:4" />Nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ peeɔ yayami ɔ, e ngɛ Mawu mlaa nɔ tɔe, ejakaa yayami peemi ji mlaa nɔ tɔmi. <verse eid="1JN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 3:5" />Nɛ nyɛ le kaa e ba plɛ e he Nɔmlɔ adesa bɔ nɛ pee nɛ e nyɛ nɛ e ngɔ wa he yayami ɔmɛ kɛ ho, lɛ nɔ nɛ yayami ko be e mi. <verse eid="1JN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 3:6" />Ke nɔ ko ngɛ e mi ɔ, e pee we yayami. Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ peeɔ yayami ɔ, e li Kristo ngɛ anɔkuale mi, nɛ e pi Kristo nɔ.<verse eid="1JN 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 3:7" />Oo ye bimɛ, nyɛ ko ha nɛ nɔ ko nɛ sisi nyɛ ngɛ enɛ ɔ he. Ke o ngɛ kpakpa pee be fɛɛ be ɔ, e tsɔɔ kaa o hi kaa bɔ nɛ Kristo ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="1JN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 3:8" />Nɔ nɛ peeɔ yayami ɔ, Abosiami Nɔmlɔ ji lɛ, ejakaa Abosiami pee yayami kɛ je sisije. Se Mawu Bi ɔ ba konɛ e ba puɛ Abosiami ni tsumi ɔmɛ. <verse eid="1JN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 3:9" />Nɔ nɛ a fɔ lɛ ngɔ wo Mawu weku ɔ mi ɔ, e pee we yayami, ejakaa Mawu wami ngɛ e mi jehanɛ. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e be nyɛe maa hi yayami pee, ejakaa a ngɔ kikɛmɛ a wami he nɛ ɔ kɛ wo e mi nɛ e ngɛ e nɔ yee; nɛ tsɔɔ kaa a fɔ lɛ ehe.<verse eid="1JN 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyɛɛ suɔ nyɛ si bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 3:10" />Enɛ ɔ ji slɔɔto nɛ ngɛ nɔ nɛ ji Mawu bi kɛ nɔ nɛ ji Abosiami nɔmlɔ kpɛti. Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ngɛ yayami peemi si himi mi nɛ e sume e nyɛmi ɔ, e sume Mawu; <verse eid="1JN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 3:11" />ejakaa munyu nɛ a kɛ ha wɔ kɛ je sisije ji kaa waa suɔ wa si bi.<verse eid="1JN 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 3:12" />Wa ko pee kaa Kain nɔ nɛ ngɛ Abosiami mi nɛ e gbe e nyɛmi ɔ. Mɛni ba nɛ e gbe lɛ? Ejakaa Kain peeɔ yayami, nɛ e le klɛdɛɛ kaa e nyɛmi ɔ hi pe lɛ. <verse eid="1JN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 3:13" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, anyɛmimɛ, e ko pee nyɛ nyakpɛ ke ji nihi sume nyɛ.<verse eid="1JN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 3:14" />Ke ji wa suɔ wa nyɛmimɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli kpahi ɔ, e tsɔɔ kaa a he wɔ kɛ je gbenɔ mi nɛ a ha wɔ neneene wami. Se nɔ nɛ be suɔmi kɛ ha ni kpahi ɔ, e nɔ ji neneene gbenɔ. <verse eid="1JN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 3:15" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ sume e nyɛmi ɔ, nɔ gbelɔ ji lɛ, nɛ nyɛ le kaa nɔ gbelɔ ko be neneene wami ngɛ e mi. <verse eid="1JN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 3:16" />Kɛ gu Kristo e gbenɔ nɛ e gbo kɛ ha wɔ ɔ mi ɔ, wa le nɔ́ nɛ ji suɔmi pɔtɛɛ. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, e sa kaa wɔ hu wa gbo ngɛ wa nyɛmimɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli a he.<verse eid="1JN 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 3:17" />Ke Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ ko ngɛ ní bɔ nɛ sa, nɛ e na e nyɛmi ngɛ fimi mi se e yi kɛ bua we lɛ ɔ, anɛ Mawu suɔmi maa hi e mi lo? <verse eid="1JN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 3:18" />Bimɛ tsɔwi, nyɛ ha nɛ wa kpa demi kɛ wa nya kɛkɛ ke wa suɔ nihi. Nyɛ ha nɛ waa suɔ mɛ ngɛ anɔkuale mi, nɛ waa kɛ wa ni peemi níhi nɛ tsɔɔ. <verse eid="1JN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 3:19" />Kɛkɛ ɔ, wa maa le tutuutu kɛ gu wa ni peemi ni ɔmɛ a mi kaa wa ngɛ Mawu blɔ fa mi, nɛ wa he nile be wɔ fɔ bue, ke ji wa daa si ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ hɛ mi tete. <verse eid="1JN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 3:20" />Ke wa he nile ngɛ wɔ fo bue, nɛ wa nu he kaa wa pee yayami ɔ, niinɛ, Nutsɔ ɔ maa nu he pe wɔ, ejakaa e leɔ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ wa peeɔ ɔ.<verse eid="1JN 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 3:21" />Se, anyɛmimɛ suɔli, ke wa he nile bui wɔ fɔ ɔ, wa ma nyɛ ba Nutsɔ ɔ ngɔ kɛ hɛ nɔ kami <verse eid="1JN 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 3:22" />nɛ wa nine maa su nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ wa bi ɔ nɔ, ejakaa wa ngɛ lɛ tue bue nɛ wa ngɛ e suɔmi nya ni pee. <verse eid="1JN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 3:23" />Nɛ enɛ ɔ ji kita nɛ Mawu wo wɔ kaa, wa he e Bi Yesu Kristo ɔ nɔ waa ye, nɛ waa suɔ wa si bi. <verse eid="1JN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 3:24" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ yeɔ Mawu kita amɛ a nɔ ɔ, e kɛ Mawu ngɛ, nɛ lɛ hu e kɛ lɛ ngɛ. Wa le enɛ ɔ kaa e ji anɔkuale, ejakaa Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɛ e kɛ ha wɔ ɔ deɔ wɔ ja.<verse eid="1JN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1JN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Nyɛɛ suɔ nyɛ he</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 4:1" />Anyɛmimɛ nɛ a suɔ, nyɛ ko he nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ nɔ ko ma de nyɛ be fɛɛ be kaa e je Mawu ngɔ ɔ kɛkɛ nɛ nyɛɛ ye. Nyɛɛ hyɛ mi ha kekle kaa e ji anɔkuale lo. Ejakaa lakpa tsɔɔli fuu ngɛ je ɔ mi. <verse eid="1JN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 4:2" />Bɔ nɛ nyɛ maa pee kɛ le ke ji a munyu ɔ je Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ngɔ ɔ ji, anɛ e tsɔɔ kaa Yesu Kristo Mawu Bi ɔ ba ngɛ nɔmlɔ su mi lo? Ke e tsɔɔ ja a, lɛɛ munyu ɔ je Mawu ngɔ. <verse eid="1JN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 4:3" />Ke pi ja a, lɛɛ munyu ɔ ji Mawu ngɔ, se mohu e je lakpa Kristo ɔ ngɔ, nɔ nɛ nyɛ nu e he kaa e maa ba, se amlɔ nɛ ɔ, e ngɛ je ɔ mi momo ɔ.<verse eid="1JN 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 4:4" />Ye bimɛ nɛ i suɔ, Mawu nihi ji nyɛ, nɛ nyɛ ye nihi nɛ te si kɛ wo Kristo ɔ nɔ kunimi momo, ejakaa nɔ nɛ ngɛ nyɛ mi ɔ e he wa pe tsɔɔlɔ yayami ko nɛ ngɛ je nɛ ɔ mi. <verse eid="1JN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 4:5" />Nimli nɛ ɔmɛ je je nɛ ɔ mi, lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, je nɛ ɔ mi níhi a he munyu nɛ a tuɔ, nɛ je ɔ buɔ mɛ tue. <verse eid="1JN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 4:6" />Se wɔɔ lɛɛ Mawu bimɛ ji wɔ. Nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ le Mawu ɔ, e buɔ wɔ tue, nɛ nɔ nɛ li Mawu ɔ, e bui wɔ tue. Kɛ gu enɛ ɔ nɔ ɔ, wa leɔ ke munyu ɔ je Mawu ngɔ niinɛ. Ejakaa ke e je Mawu ngɔ ɔ, lɛɛ je ɔ be munyu ɔ tue bue.<verse eid="1JN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 4:7" />Anyɛmimɛ, nyɛ ha nɛ waa suɔ wa he, ejakaa suɔmi je Mawu ngɔ, nɛ nihi nɛ suɔmi ngɛ a mi nɛ a mi mi jɔ ɔ, e tsɔɔ kaa a ji Mawu bimɛ nɛ a le Mawu. <verse eid="1JN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 4:8" />Se ke nɔ ko be suɔmi nɛ e mi mi jɔɛ ɔ, e tsɔɔ kaa e li Mawu, ejakaa Mawu ɔ suɔmi i.<verse eid="1JN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 4:9" />Mawu tsɔɔ wɔ e suɔmi nɛ e ngɛ kɛ ha wɔ kɛ gu e Bi kake too ɔ nɛ e tsɔ kɛ ba je ɔ mi ɔ nɔ, nɛ e ngɔ neneene wami kɛ ba ha wɔ kɛ gu e gbenɔ ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="1JN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 4:10" />Ngɛ enɛ ɔ mi ɔ, wa na bɔ nɛ anɔkuale suɔmi ngɛ ha. Tsa pi wɔ nɛ wa suɔ Mawu, se lɛ nɛ e suɔ wɔ, nɛ e tsɔ e Bi ɔ kɛ ba kaa bɔ sami nɔ, nɛ e kɛ je wa he yayami ɔmɛ kɛ ho.<verse eid="1JN 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 4:11" />Ye suɔli, si abɔ nɛ Mawu suɔ wɔ ja a, e sa nɛ wɔ hu waa suɔ wa si bi. <verse eid="1JN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 4:12" />Wa nɛ Mawu hyɛ mohu, se ke wa suɔ wa si bi ɔ, Mawu maa hi wa mi nɛ e suɔmi ɔ hu maa wa ngɛ wa mi. <verse eid="1JN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 4:13" />Nɛ e ngɔ lɛ nitsɛ e Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ kɛ wo wa tsui mi, nɛ e kɛ tsɔɔ kaa waa kɛ lɛ ngɛ, nɛ lɛ hu e kɛ wɔ ngɛ. <verse eid="1JN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 4:14" />Jehanɛ ɔ hu wa na kɛ wɔ nitsɛmɛ wa hɛ ngmɛ, nɛ wa de je ɔ tsuo kaa Mawu tsɔ e Bi ɔ kɛ ba nɛ e ba he a yi wami. <verse eid="1JN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 4:15" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ heɔ yeɔ, nɛ e deɔ ke Yesu ɔ Mawu Bi ji lɛ ɔ, Mawu ngɛ e mi, nɛ lɛ hu e ngɛ Mawu mi.<verse eid="1JN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 4:16" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, wa le nɛ wa heɔ Mawu suɔmi nɛ e ngɛ kɛ ha wɔ ɔ yeɔ. Mawu ɔ suɔmi i, nɛ nɔ nɛ ngɛ suɔmi ɔ, e ngɛ Mawu mi, nɛ Mawu hu ngɛ e mi. <verse eid="1JN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 4:17" />Nɛ akɛnɛ waa kɛ Kristo ngɛ he je ɔ, wa suɔmi ɔ waa nɛ e hii kɛ pii si. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, wa hɛ mi be si puee, nɛ wa be haoe ngɛ kojomi ligbi ɔ nɔ. Se wa maa da si ngɛ e hɛ mi kɛ hɛ nɔ kami kɛ bua jɔmi, ejakaa e suɔ wɔ nɛ wɔ hu wa suɔ lɛ.<verse eid="1JN 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 4:18" />E sɛ kaa waa ye nɔ ko nɛ suɔ wɔ kɛ pi si ɔ gbeye; e suɔmi nɛ hi kɛ pi si ɔ jeɔ gbeye nɛ wa maa ye lɛ, kaa e maa pee wɔ nɔ ko ɔ. Ke wa ngɛ gbeye yee ɔ, eko ɔ, wa ngɛ nɔ nɛ e maa pee wɔ ɔ gbeye yee; nɛ tsɔɔ kaa wa be nɔ mi mami pɔtɛɛ kaa e suɔ wɔ anɔkuale mi. <verse eid="1JN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 4:19" />Wa suɔ lɛ, ejakaa lɛ kekle nɛ e suɔ wɔ.<verse eid="1JN 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 4:20" />Ke ji nɔ ko ke, “I suɔ Mawu,” se e ngɛ e nyɛmi nyɛe kɛ sa a, lakpatsɛ ji lɛ. Ejakaa, ke e sume e nyɛmi nɛ e ngɛ hyɛe ɔ, kɛ e ma plɛ kɛ suɔ Mawu nɛ enɛ lɛ hyɛ ɔ kɛɛ? <verse eid="1JN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 4:21" />Nɛ Mawu nitsɛ wo kita kaa, pi lɛ kɛkɛ nɛ e sa nɛ a suɔ, se nɔ nyɛmi hulɔ.<verse eid="1JN 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1JN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Waa le nɔ́ nɛ ji anɔkuale ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 5:1" />Nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ heɔ yeɔ kaa Yesu ji Kristo ɔ, nɛ lɛ ji Mawu Bi kɛ e Yiwamihelɔ ɔ, Mawu bi ji lɛ. Nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ suɔ Tsɛ ɔ, e suɔ e bimɛ hulɔ. <verse eid="1JN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 5:2" />Ke wa suɔ Mawu nɛ wa yeɔ e mlaa amɛ a nɔ ɔ, lɛɛ wa suɔ Mawu bi ɔmɛ. <verse eid="1JN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 5:3" />Mawu suɔmi ji e mlaa amɛ a nɔ yemi. Nɛ e mlaa amɛ a nɔ yemi wɛ; <verse eid="1JN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 5:4" />ejakaa nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ ji Mawu bi ɔ buɔ lɛ tue. E maa ye yayami kɛ akɔnɔ níhi nɛ a ji yayami ɔ nɔ, kɛ gu Kristo nɔ hemi kɛ yemi nɔ, kaa e maa ye kɛ bua lɛ.<verse eid="1JN 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 5:5" />Se mɛnɔ nɛ e yeɔ je ɔ nɔ kunimi? Ja nɔ nɛ heɔ yeɔ kaa Yesu ji Mawu Bi. <verse eid="1JN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 5:6" />Yesu Kristo ji nɔ nɛ ba; e ba kɛ e baptisimi nyu ɔ kɛ e gbenɔ muɔ ɔ. Pi nyu ɔ kɛkɛ nɛ e kɛ ba, se nyu kɛ muɔ tsuo. <verse eid="1JN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 5:7" />Nɛ Mumi ɔ nitsɛ yeɔ he odase kaa enɛ ɔ ji anɔkuale, ejakaa Mumi ɔ, anɔkuale i. <verse eid="1JN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 5:8" />Odase yeli etɛ nɛ ngɛ, Mumi ɔ kɛ nyu ɔ, kɛ muɔ ɔ; nɛ mɛ níhi etɛ nɛ ɔmɛ tsuo a gbi pee kake. <verse eid="1JN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 5:9" />Wa ngɔɔ nimli a odase yemi, se Mawu e odase yemi kle pe nimli a nɔ́, nɛ Mawu e odase nɛ e ye ngɛ e Bi ɔ he ji enɛ ɔ nɛ. <verse eid="1JN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 5:10" />Nihi kulaa nɛ heɔ enɛ ɔ yeɔ ɔ, a le ngɛ a tsui mi kaa e ji anɔkuale. Ke nɔ ko he we enɛ ɔ yi ɔ, lɛɛ e ngɛ Mawu tsɛe ke lakpatsɛ. Ejakaa e he we nɔ́ nɛ Mawu de ngɛ e Bi ɔ he ɔ yi<verse eid="1JN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 5:11" />Nɛ odase ɔ ji, kaa Mawu ha wɔ neneene wami, nɛ kikɛmɛ a wami ɔ ngɛ e Bi ɔ mi. <verse eid="1JN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 5:12" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ heɔ Mawu Bi ɔ nɔ yeɔ ɔ, e ngɛ wami; nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ he we e Bi ɔ nɔ yi ɔ, e be wami.<verse eid="1JN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 5:13" />I ngɛ nyɛ nihi nɛ nyɛ heɔ Mawu Bi ɔ nɔ yeɔ ɔ enɛ ɔ ngmae konɛ nyɛ na nɛ nyɛɛ le kaa nyɛ ngɛ neneene wami. <verse eid="1JN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 5:14" />Nɛ wa heɔ enɛ ɔ yeɔ, kaa be fɛɛ be ke wa bi lɛ nɔ́ ko ngɛ e suɔmi nya a, e maa bu wɔ tue. <verse eid="1JN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 5:15" />Nɛ ke wa le anɔkuale mi kaa e buɔ wɔ tue be fɛɛ be nɛ wa ma bi lɛ nɔ́ ko ɔ, lɛɛ wa ngɛ nɔ mi mami kaa e ma ha wɔ heto.<verse eid="1JN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 5:16" />Ke o na o nyɛmi nɛ e ngɛ yayami ko pee nɛ gbenɔ be mi jee ɔ, o bi Mawu nɛ e kɛ pa lɛ. E ma ha lɛ wami, ja e pee yayami nɛ e kɛ gbenɔ baa. Yayami ɔ eko ngɛ nɛ gbenɔ jee mi, nɛ ke kɔlɔ ɔ nɛ e pee ɔ, se nami be he kaa a sɔle kɛ ha lɛ. <verse eid="1JN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 5:17" />Nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ ji tɔmi ɔ, yayami i. Se yayami ɔ eko ngɛ nɛ e pee we gbenɔ.<verse eid="1JN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 5:18" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ peeɔ Mawu weku ɔ mi no ɔ, e pee we yayami. Ejakaa Kristo nɛ ji Mawu Bi ɔ e buu e he, nɛ Abosiami na we e he blɔ. <verse eid="1JN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 5:19" />Wa le kaa Mawu bimɛ ji wɔ, se je ɔ tsuo nɛ bɔle wɔ ɔ ngɛ Abosiami he wami kɛ nɔ yemi sisi. <verse eid="1JN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 5:20" />Nɛ wa le hu kaa Kristo nɛ ji Mawu Bi ɔ, e ba nɛ e ba ye kɛ bua wɔ nɛ waa le anɔkuale Mawu ɔ. Nɛ amlɔ nɛ ɔ, wa peeɔ Mawu bimɛ, ejakaa wa peeɔ e Bi Yesu Kristo ɔ se nyɛɛli. Lɛ pɛ ji anɔkuale Mawu; nɛ lɛ ji neneene wami ɔ.<verse eid="1JN 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 5:21" />Bimɛ nɛ a suɔ, nyɛ je nyɛ he kɛ je nɔ́ ko nɛ ma je Mawu kɛ je nyɛ tsui mi ɔ he. Amen.<verse eid="1JN 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 5" />
</usx>